      "statement": "ApprovalService (packages/server/src/services/approval-service.ts) owns the `approvals` table and its full lifecycle: rows move pending -> approved | denied | expired, and every operator surface (REST routes, dashboard, Telegram) ultimately acts through this service via ExecutionEngine.handleApprovalDecision.",
