      "id": "claim_6ff15a743e4446478b2477a5cd6b71a1",
      "statement": "recordDecision() appends every lifecycle step to the append-only authority_events ledger via recordAuthorityEvent (sequenced per correlation_id = task id, sha-256 payload digest, actor classified human/agent/service by the 'system' sentinel and 'agent:' prefix rule) with HOLD on request, ALLOW/DENY on decision, and DENY with EXECUTION_APPROVAL_EXPIRED on expiry; recording is best-effort and returns null instead of throwing if the authority_events table is absent.",
